---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Solutions | EVO"
  description="Explore EVO solutions across industrial automation, smart living, custom engineering and connected systems."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">EVO SOLUTIONS</p>
        <h1>Engineering systems that <span>work together.</span></h1>
        <p>From production machinery to intelligent spaces, EVO combines practical engineering, automation and connected control into clear solutions built around real use.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions">
          <a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Discuss a Project ↗</a>
          <a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/projects">See Our Work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="page-orb"></div>
        <img src="/hero/evo-hero-spatial.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">FOUR CORE PILLARS</p>
          <h2>A practical path from <span>problem to system.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each solution area can stand on its own or connect with the others as part of a larger EVO platform.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid-4">
        <article class="service-tile">
          <div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">01</span><h3>Industrial<br />Automation</h3><p>PLC, HMI, SCADA, panels, machine integration and production control.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/industrial-automation">↗</a></div>
          <div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-industrial-automation.png" alt="Industrial automation robotic arm" /></div>
        </article>
        <article class="service-tile">
          <div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">02</span><h3>Smart<br />Living</h3><p>Connected lighting, climate, access, audio and everyday scenes.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/smart-living">↗</a></div>
          <div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-smart-living.png" alt="Smart living interior" /></div>
        </article>
        <article class="service-tile">
          <div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">03</span><h3>Custom<br />Engineering</h3><p>Purpose-built machines, modifications, prototypes and technical systems.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/custom-engineering">↗</a></div>
          <div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-custom-engineering.png" alt="Custom engineering concept" /></div>
        </article>
        <article class="service-tile">
          <div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">04</span><h3>Systems &amp;<br />Integrations</h3><p>Connected software, monitoring and integration layers for complex systems.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/systems-integrations">↗</a></div>
          <div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-systems-integrations.png" alt="Systems integration platform" /></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">HOW EVO WORKS</p><h2>One team. <span>One technical path.</span></h2></div>
        <p>We start with the problem, define the operating reality, then shape the right mix of mechanical, electrical, control and software work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <div class="process-step"><span>01</span><strong>Understand</strong><p>Clarify the problem, constraints, users and operating environment.</p></div>
        <div class="process-step"><span>02</span><strong>Design</strong><p>Choose the architecture, controls, interfaces and mechanical approach.</p></div>
        <div class="process-step"><span>03</span><strong>Build</strong><p>Integrate hardware, software, panels, machines and connected systems.</p></div>
        <div class="process-step"><span>04</span><strong>Improve</strong><p>Commission, refine and support the system around real use.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-panel">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH THE PROBLEM</p><h2>Need something <span>outside the usual box?</span></h2><p>EVO is built for work that crosses disciplines and needs a practical engineering answer.</p></div>
      <a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to EVO ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
